  "design": {
    "entrance": "Two intertwined helices of glowing particles spiral up from the dark, widen at the top and then stream inward, each spark flying to its own point on the letterforms.",
    "reveal": "On the impact frame the converged sparks ignite the title in a bright white-gold flash that throws two wing-like arcs of embers outward, then settles into a clean, readable gold hold.",
    "camera": "Slow upward tilt following the spiral, small lift-and-settle at the ignition.",
    "material": "Radiant sun-gold metal with crimson rim light and a white-hot edge that cools after ignition; emissive particles with soft bloom.",
    "exit": "The title is reborn again as embers: it dissolves bottom-to-top into sparks that spiral up and away."
  },
  "fusion_notes": [
    "The spiral is two pEmitters whose positions orbit the vertical axis by expression (helix); per-particle target convergence onto the glyphs is approximated by a radial zoom-in of the particle render plus the ignition flash (Fusion particles cannot target text pixels without extra tools)."
  ],
